## Current assignments

Apps: system-explorer `computer-pc`, net-explorer `globe`, sector-recover `computer-recovery`,
operator-notes `notepad-pencil`, photo-viewer `document-image`, messenger `chat-bubble`,
dev-tools-target `circuit-board`. File types: image `document-image`, audio `cd-music`,
system `chip`, text `document`. Explorer: drive `hard-drive`, folders `folder`. Dialog error `error`.
Restart `plug`. Upgrades: `document-search`, `data-nodes`, `hard-drive-external`.
